e race. He was the first driver from Monaco to win it since 1931.","Formula E, the all-electric racing series, also races on these streets."]},{"s":419.8,"texts":["The hairpin here is the slowest corner in Formula One, taken at about thirty miles an hour.","The cars come round this hairpin so slowly that drivers use their tightest steering lock in all of Formula One.","In 2024 Monaco opened Mareterra, a new seaside district built out over the sea, making the whole country about three percent bigger."]},{"s":2333.5,"texts":["Monaco's tunnel, under the Fairmont hotel, is one of the rare places where Formula One cars race underground.","Overtaking is so hard here that the race is often won in qualifying, the day before.","In Iron Man 2, Tony Stark races a car at the Monaco Historic Grand Prix, and is attacked out on the track.","Every September, Port Hercule fills with superyachts for the Monaco Yacht Show."]}]}